  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Header.png\" alt=\"Pastel 光影的標誌\" width=\"1024\" height=\"324\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ffe8e9&labelColor=ffced2&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=blue\" width=\"205\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SUPPORTS-IRIS, OCULUS, OPTIFINE | 1.7 to 1.20-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"385\" height=\"28\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-SUPPORT ME-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&logo=Ko-Fi&labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"212\" height=\"27\"></a></em><em>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fELOCIN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Promo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1018\" height=\"151\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Pastel Shaders 是一款風格化的美學光影包，內建多種色彩預設</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066006073456197652/presets-transparent.gif\" alt=\"Pastel Shaders 中的三種預設展示\" width=\"1200\" height=\"608\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066223943956041748/highperformance.png\" alt=\"Pastel 是一款高效能光影。\" width=\"1120\" height=\"567\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🎨 多種色彩預設</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">從粉紅、藍到黃的柔和色調，任您挑選！&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🌌 寧靜氛圍</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;提供接近原版的體驗，搭配清澈星空與美麗日出日落。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>✏️ 高度自訂</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;無論新手或進階玩家，皆可輕鬆自訂，幾乎無上限！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚙️ 友善的設定選單</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;設定選項太多讓你眼花撩亂？Pastel 提供類似多數現代遊戲的快速設定。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">現代遊戲的快速設定。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>💻&nbsp;在大多數現代電腦上運行順暢</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;即使入門級獨顯或內建顯示晶片也已最佳化！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>☁️ 《Insanity Shaderpack》的姊妹作</strong></span>\n<p>Pastel 是 Insanity 的對應版本，基於 BSL Shaders 打造 &hearts;！</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
